WEBVTT

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:32.209
[Full-Time Magister 2]

00:00:34.218 --> 00:00:37.371
♪ The rising dawn
cuts through the night ♪

00:00:37.625 --> 00:00:40.321
♪ And destroys the darkness ♪

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:44.407
♪ A new wing shall emerge ♪

00:00:44.861 --> 00:00:48.043
♪ And soar through the sky ♪

00:00:48.873 --> 00:00:52.215
♪ Smoke appears in
conflicted dimensions ♪

00:00:52.527 --> 00:00:55.165
♪ Waiting for someone's arrival ♪

00:00:55.547 --> 00:01:00.092
♪ Protecting the unshakable
belief within us ♪

00:01:00.332 --> 00:01:02.230
♪ And never backs down ♪

00:01:02.865 --> 00:01:06.729
♪ The sacred fountain lays there ♪

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:10.491
♪ Shocked by what had appeared
in front of us ♪

00:01:10.877 --> 00:01:13.923
♪ The star atlas has open
a path for our journey ♪

00:01:14.078 --> 00:01:17.363
♪ Laughing while we watch
the world from above ♪

00:01:17.796 --> 00:01:20.898
♪ He had given me everything ♪

00:01:20.992 --> 00:01:25.076
♪ The truth in sight is unpleasant ♪

00:01:25.116 --> 00:01:27.838
♪ Anger that is insurmountable ♪

00:01:27.839 --> 00:01:32.247
♪ That unique soul
was born to be a hero ♪

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:35.517
♪ The torrential rain can't be
stopped by the hot-blooded ♪

00:01:35.557 --> 00:01:39.442
♪ The chosen one will not
bid farewell easily ♪

00:01:39.464 --> 00:01:42.307
♪ I will create a miracle ♪

00:01:42.308 --> 00:01:47.844
♪ With the burning fire
in my wounded heart ♪

00:01:48.051 --> 00:01:52.142
♪ I promise ♪

00:02:04.623 --> 00:02:05.490
Xinxia!

00:02:23.819 --> 00:02:24.673
Damn it!

00:02:25.147 --> 00:02:26.161
Damn it!

00:02:26.185 --> 00:02:27.372
Damn it!

00:02:29.334 --> 00:02:32.709
If I go out,
I will be shredded to pieces.

00:02:33.417 --> 00:02:35.626
I can't save Xinxia if that happened.

00:02:37.113 --> 00:02:39.766
Cyclops have bad eyesights.

00:02:40.042 --> 00:02:42.668
Most of the time, they use their eye
to detect heat activities.

00:02:43.158 --> 00:02:45.385
If you're in danger,

00:02:45.465 --> 00:02:47.668
you can use ice magic
to protect yourself.

00:02:47.876 --> 00:02:49.794
With that, you won't be discovered.

00:02:51.083 --> 00:02:52.083
Ice magic?

00:02:53.050 --> 00:02:54.490
To avoid them,

00:02:54.696 --> 00:02:57.283
Xinxia hid in a refrigerator.

00:02:57.604 --> 00:03:00.510
Even though it's a desperate situation,
she didn't give up.

00:03:00.577 --> 00:03:01.761
She's trying to survive!

00:03:02.992 --> 00:03:03.872
I...

00:03:05.452 --> 00:03:07.706
How can I just wait for my death?

00:03:16.049 --> 00:03:16.849
No.

00:03:17.212 --> 00:03:19.158
If I stay here any longer...

00:03:53.745 --> 00:03:56.641
If I stay here,
Xinxia would be in danger.

00:03:57.160 --> 00:03:58.627
You disgusting monsters!

00:03:58.792 --> 00:03:59.917
You want to kill me?

00:03:59.985 --> 00:04:01.158
Come then!

00:04:06.192 --> 00:04:08.005
Let's see who's the one being hunted...

00:04:08.274 --> 00:04:10.368
when you break down this door.

00:04:11.776 --> 00:04:13.750
I must break my limits this time.

00:04:28.312 --> 00:04:29.392
What's going on?

00:04:30.051 --> 00:04:31.464
Why is it glowing?

00:04:36.302 --> 00:04:37.622
Is it because of the Sacred Spring?

00:04:37.893 --> 00:04:40.653
Did Catfish absorb the essence
of the Sacred Spring?

00:04:55.076 --> 00:04:56.903
It's evolving from Stardust to Nebula!

00:04:59.430 --> 00:05:00.643
At the Nebula level,

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:02.323
you will have more then 7 Stars.

00:05:02.865 --> 00:05:05.074
You'll have 49 Stars.

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:07.934
You need to link the 49 Stars...

00:05:07.977 --> 00:05:10.923
into 7 Star Paths without any mistakes.

00:05:11.501 --> 00:05:15.127
And arrange the 7 Star Paths
into a complete Starchart.

00:05:21.364 --> 00:05:23.832
Starchart-level?
This is a Starchart-level fire?

00:05:24.387 --> 00:05:25.280
This feeling...

00:05:42.372 --> 00:05:45.348
Reduce to ashes! Fiery Fist!

00:06:05.864 --> 00:06:08.654
Runnig away? Do you think
you're faster than my fire?

00:06:09.257 --> 00:06:10.391
Go to hell!

00:06:17.033 --> 00:06:17.900
Thunder Magic.

00:06:32.587 --> 00:06:33.427
You!

00:06:34.164 --> 00:06:36.124
All of you should go to hell!

00:07:38.287 --> 00:07:39.341
Brother Mo Fan!

00:08:03.565 --> 00:08:04.392
Xinxia.

00:08:05.973 --> 00:08:07.039
Brother Mo Fan.

00:08:12.228 --> 00:08:13.698
Xinxia?

00:08:17.392 --> 00:08:19.390
Xinxia! Wake up!

00:08:19.656 --> 00:08:21.403
I'm Mo Fan! I'm here to save you!

00:08:26.954 --> 00:08:27.701
She's cold.

00:08:49.035 --> 00:08:50.142
Brother Mo Fan.

00:08:51.852 --> 00:08:54.031
You're still alive!
My Xinxia is still alive!

00:08:54.542 --> 00:08:55.565
This is great!

00:08:57.749 --> 00:08:59.349
Brother Mo Fan.

00:08:59.565 --> 00:09:02.302
I thought I couldn't see you anymore.

00:09:03.068 --> 00:09:04.122
That won't happen.

00:09:07.347 --> 00:09:08.400
Look.

00:09:09.393 --> 00:09:11.635
Where did you find this?

00:09:11.793 --> 00:09:13.127
I thought I had given it to...

00:09:17.388 --> 00:09:19.855
Do you remember the words
I've said when I bought it for you?

00:09:20.614 --> 00:09:24.991
This bracelet represents the
unique position you have in my heart.

00:09:26.915 --> 00:09:28.608
See? I didn't lie.

00:09:29.393 --> 00:09:30.126
Xinxia.

00:09:30.593 --> 00:09:33.248
No matter what happens, I will find you.

00:09:33.659 --> 00:09:35.829
And stay beside you. Understood?

00:09:38.711 --> 00:09:39.324
Yes!

00:09:41.516 --> 00:09:42.303
Let's go.

00:09:43.505 --> 00:09:44.665
Brother Mo Fan.

00:09:52.078 --> 00:09:54.532
Why are they running away from you?

00:09:55.559 --> 00:09:57.212
They'll die if they come close.

00:09:57.632 --> 00:09:59.725
At least they know their place.

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:03.780
Brother Mo Fan,
are you a Starchart mage now?

00:10:04.251 --> 00:10:05.198
My fire is Starchart-level.

00:10:05.478 --> 00:10:08.224
Luckily, Miss Tang Yue
gave me some Starchart books.

00:10:08.627 --> 00:10:10.827
That helped me to use
Starchart-level fire magic.

00:10:11.461 --> 00:10:13.501
If not, maybe we won't
get to see each other.

00:10:14.385 --> 00:10:18.334
You're amazing! If the low-level monsters
come in small packs,

00:10:18.456 --> 00:10:20.563
they can't pose a threat to you.

00:10:21.693 --> 00:10:24.067
Slave-level monsters
can't even touch us.

00:10:24.756 --> 00:10:27.823
But there are some
Warrior-level demons in the city.

00:10:28.087 --> 00:10:29.953
Like Thorn-Faced Wolf.

00:10:30.822 --> 00:10:33.449
Even though I'm a Starchart-level
fire mage right now,

00:10:33.801 --> 00:10:35.655
I don't know if I can beat it.

00:10:38.278 --> 00:10:39.345
Have some rest.

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:41.610
Thank you.

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:55.010
The city turned into this
in such a short time.

00:10:55.236 --> 00:10:57.978
There are many monsters.
I don't know if...

00:10:58.045 --> 00:11:00.576
Officer Cheng and the others manage
to destroy the monsters' entrances.

00:11:00.788 --> 00:11:04.466
If they fail, even the protective
barrier can't stay safe for long.

00:11:05.031 --> 00:11:06.456
Oh yeah! Brother Mo Fan!

00:11:06.522 --> 00:11:08.103
I discovered someone strange.

00:11:08.159 --> 00:11:10.732
Did you remember the girl that
went missing in our school?

00:11:10.839 --> 00:11:14.793
Of course! Our hunting team discovered
the first rampant Cyclops there.

00:11:14.985 --> 00:11:16.998
It's a pity we didn't find the girl.

00:11:17.918 --> 00:11:20.825
I don't think the girl was
taken away by the monsters.

00:11:21.853 --> 00:11:23.293
On the day she went missing,

00:11:23.346 --> 00:11:25.590
I saw someone who was dressed in gray.

00:11:25.982 --> 00:11:27.635
They went the same way.

00:11:27.998 --> 00:11:29.438
After that, the girl went missing.

00:11:31.162 --> 00:11:32.535
Can you describe the guy?

00:11:33.258 --> 00:11:36.124
He has a special scent.
He smells like rot.

00:11:36.418 --> 00:11:38.951
Before the monsters
appeared in the city,

00:11:39.281 --> 00:11:41.439
I picked up the same scent
when I was in the supermarket.

00:11:43.924 --> 00:11:46.604
Does it smell like the swamp?

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:48.020
Yes.

00:11:48.635 --> 00:11:49.649
The Black Beasts!

00:11:49.822 --> 00:11:50.889
It's the Black Curia!

00:11:51.102 --> 00:11:53.751
Don't tell me the girl that
went missing that day...

00:11:53.791 --> 00:11:55.878
accidentally discovered
the monsters' entrances?

00:11:56.078 --> 00:11:59.453
The Black Curia made her disappear
to keep that a secret.

00:12:00.635 --> 00:12:02.994
Brother Mo Fan.
If it was the Black Curia,

00:12:03.292 --> 00:12:06.709
I think they'll send someone
to patrol the entrances.

00:12:08.645 --> 00:12:11.534
Yeah! That explains
the presence of Yu Ang!

00:12:12.359 --> 00:12:14.398
Oh no! They're in big trouble now!

00:12:21.060 --> 00:12:23.288
Xinxia, I'll send you into
the protective barrier.

00:12:23.658 --> 00:12:24.658
Send me first?

00:12:25.066 --> 00:12:26.737
-How about you?
-I...

00:12:26.910 --> 00:12:29.078
I have some important things to do.

00:12:32.035 --> 00:12:32.835
I...

00:12:34.194 --> 00:12:34.941
What's wrong?

00:12:37.669 --> 00:12:39.934
I'm fine.
I'm just a little giddy.

00:12:43.312 --> 00:12:44.552
That's a serious injury!

00:12:45.419 --> 00:12:47.059
I got that when I was dealing
with the Black Beasts.

00:12:48.593 --> 00:12:49.179
Here.

00:12:53.197 --> 00:12:53.984
You're...

00:13:04.632 --> 00:13:07.148
This is healing magic?

00:13:08.477 --> 00:13:09.504
How do you feel?

00:13:12.782 --> 00:13:16.262
I almost forgot that our Xinxia
is a mage with healing magic!

00:13:17.999 --> 00:13:20.971
You're the first mage with
healing magic in Bow City!

00:13:22.619 --> 00:13:25.192
Brother Mo Fan.
Do you have any other injuries?

00:13:25.366 --> 00:13:27.379
-Let me take a look.
-I'm fine.

00:13:34.274 --> 00:13:35.381
By the way, Xinxia,

00:13:35.640 --> 00:13:37.640
How strong is your healing magic?

00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:39.100
If someone's throat was cut,

00:13:39.223 --> 00:13:41.729
can you save them
with your healing magic?

00:13:43.594 --> 00:13:45.474
If they're dead in an instant,

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:47.494
my healing magic won't work.

00:13:48.874 --> 00:13:52.152
You're right.
But your magic is good enough.

00:13:54.918 --> 00:13:57.117
Let's go now.
If you get inside the barrier,

00:13:57.382 --> 00:13:58.955
many people will need your help.

00:13:59.292 --> 00:14:02.292
Your skill is greater than
most medicines.

00:14:05.480 --> 00:14:07.080
You haven't answer my question yet.

00:14:07.960 --> 00:14:09.226
I'm going back.

00:14:09.697 --> 00:14:10.364
How about you?

00:14:12.795 --> 00:14:13.475
Xinxia.

00:14:13.956 --> 00:14:16.794
Did you witness any strange holes...

00:14:17.234 --> 00:14:18.594
inside your school?

00:14:20.693 --> 00:14:22.266
When I escaped from there,

00:14:22.507 --> 00:14:24.761
I saw a big hole
in the middle of the field.

00:14:24.934 --> 00:14:25.877
What do you plan to do?

00:14:27.710 --> 00:14:30.567
This is the city we live in.
We grew up here.

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:34.167
I wanted to learn magic because
I wanted to be successful.

00:14:34.986 --> 00:14:37.026
I want both Dad and you
to lead a good life.

00:14:37.822 --> 00:14:40.956
So you won't
be bullied anymore.

00:14:41.744 --> 00:14:44.864
And you won't be forced
to do something you don't like.

00:14:47.591 --> 00:14:48.697
Brother Mo Fan.

00:14:49.382 --> 00:14:51.209
But now, Bow City is in a bad state.

00:14:51.501 --> 00:14:55.835
The One-eyed Wolf Demons
are eating us one-by-one.

00:14:56.204 --> 00:14:58.805
Nobody was spared.

00:15:00.578 --> 00:15:02.417
During the school's orientation,

00:15:03.175 --> 00:15:05.095
Principal Zhu told us
the duties of a mage.

00:15:05.866 --> 00:15:08.373
But I didn't think that
I would live to see this day.

00:15:09.475 --> 00:15:11.721
Now, the reality is in front of my eyes.

00:15:12.187 --> 00:15:14.334
I can't just hide
in the protective barrier.

00:15:14.424 --> 00:15:16.330
And wait for the instructors
to clean this up.

00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:19.026
But we're not strong enough yet.

00:15:19.265 --> 00:15:22.519
We can't fight the Azure-Winged Wolf
like your Head Instructor.

00:15:22.896 --> 00:15:24.643
I know I'm not strong enough.

00:15:24.989 --> 00:15:26.895
I don't know what will happen
to Bow City.

00:15:27.148 --> 00:15:30.562
I don't know if I can change
the situation with my actions.

00:15:30.893 --> 00:15:32.559
But if our instructors lose the battle,

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:36.027
our only protective barrier
will be jeopardized too.

00:15:36.361 --> 00:15:40.011
The monsters are flooding in,
even if I were ten times stronger,

00:15:40.091 --> 00:15:41.744
I can't protect you and Dad.

00:15:41.877 --> 00:15:44.457
If that happened,
I would regret that my whole life.

00:15:50.876 --> 00:15:54.251
I will have regrets because I didn't
try my best to protect Bow City.

00:15:55.251 --> 00:15:58.070
I will go and destroy
the monsters' entrances.

00:15:58.706 --> 00:15:59.386
Okay.

00:16:00.481 --> 00:16:02.041
But I won't guarantee that
I'll make it out alive.

00:16:02.471 --> 00:16:03.831
-That's why...
-Let's go.

00:16:04.103 --> 00:16:04.823
What?

00:16:05.622 --> 00:16:06.916
I'll go with you.

00:16:07.630 --> 00:16:08.350
But...

00:16:10.597 --> 00:16:12.157
If something happened to you,

00:16:12.397 --> 00:16:15.230
I would crawl out of my way to find you.

00:16:15.852 --> 00:16:17.945
Let's go to the school together.

00:16:17.986 --> 00:16:18.759
Xinxia.

00:16:18.973 --> 00:16:22.702
If I don't contribute my strength now,
I will have regrets too.

00:16:33.259 --> 00:16:34.976
-Hold on tight.
-Okay.

00:16:56.839 --> 00:16:59.214
♪ Pressing onward courageously ♪

00:16:59.917 --> 00:17:03.327
♪ With the burning dreams in our heart ♪

00:17:03.597 --> 00:17:06.648
♪ We are reminiscing
the dreams of our past ♪

00:17:07.289 --> 00:17:08.769
♪ And it gives me strength ♪

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:11.063
♪ The most stubborn wings ♪

00:17:11.677 --> 00:17:14.723
♪ Dreamt that we will not
wander anymore ♪

00:17:15.055 --> 00:17:18.980
♪ And hoped that we will
fly further one day ♪

00:17:20.453 --> 00:17:24.378
♪ With the dim lights
shining through the sky ♪

00:17:25.371 --> 00:17:30.318
♪ Shine through our heart
and fill in the ups and downs ♪

00:17:31.379 --> 00:17:34.640
♪ I'm as proud as the sun ♪

00:17:34.952 --> 00:17:37.806
♪ The clouds are moving
in the distance ♪

00:17:38.073 --> 00:17:40.398
♪ Since I have decided to be unique ♪

00:17:40.541 --> 00:17:43.449
♪ I will break all barriers
and shine through ♪

00:17:43.774 --> 00:17:46.496
♪ Life is ever-changing ♪

00:17:46.631 --> 00:17:50.048
♪ But I will soar through the sky ♪

00:17:50.374 --> 00:17:52.343
♪ The hope that is beating within me ♪

00:17:52.915 --> 00:17:56.012
♪ Writes a new chapter for me ♪

00:17:56.557 --> 00:18:00.396
♪ We will battle once more
if we have the chance ♪

00:18:00.984 --> 00:18:07.221
♪ To be the everlasting light
in the world ♪
